# .deb packages built by packaging/linux/*.sh. `dist/` also holds tracked
# upstream packaging *templates* (dist/linux, dist/macos, dist/windows), so
# only the archives are ignored. Address and hash them from the script output
# or `docs/INSTALL.md`; they are reproducible, not source.
/dist/*.deb
